{"nodes": [{"id": "_specify_bugs_contrato_json_inferido_inoperante_assessment_contrato_json_inferido_inoperante", "label": "Bug Assessment: contrato-json-inferido-inoperante - contract inert (Metade B) + not persisted (Metade C)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".specify/bugs/contrato-json-inferido-inoperante/assessment.md", "source_location": "L1-L22", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_specify_bugs_contrato_json_inferido_inoperante_assessment_fr_009_literal_gate", "label": "FR-009 literal contract-key gate (root cause of inert contract)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".specify/bugs/contrato-json-inferido-inoperante/assessment.md", "source_location": "L180-L195, L324-L334", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The gate assumes contract vocabulary coincides with flag vocabulary; a domain contract (entityName, attributes[]) never contains entity_name or custom_entity_attributes_list keys, so every LLM proposal derived from the contract is discarded - result: 0 CONTRACT / 0 INFERENCE / 32 DEFAULT, the declared 'fonte da verdade' contract is inert."}, {"id": "_specify_bugs_contrato_json_inferido_inoperante_assessment_contract_derivation_rules", "label": "Deterministic contract-to-entity derivation rules (type from value, java.lang-only, strict Tipo:nome format)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".specify/bugs/contrato-json-inferido-inoperante/assessment.md", "source_location": "L400-L438", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Everything deterministic (reading attributes in map or list form, estimating the Java type from the JSON value, assembling the strict Tipo:nome list, forcing enable_custom_entity_attributes) moves into the mechanism; the LLM only estimates the entity name. Types are restricted to java.lang because the entity template emits no import for attribute types - anything else produces a project that does not compile."}, {"id": "_specify_bugs_contrato_json_inferido_inoperante_assessment_fr_009_allowlist", "label": "FR-009 allowlist relaxation (entity_name accepted without literal contract key)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".specify/bugs/contrato-json-inferido-inoperante/assessment.md", "source_location": "L440-L457", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A minimal explicit allowlist (entity_name, optionally entity_package_name) lets an INFERENCE proposal pass without a literal contract key, provided the value matches the catalog validationRegex; all other flags keep the strict gate, and allowlisted keys must not appear in the discarded-proposals section."}, {"id": "_specify_bugs_contrato_json_inferido_inoperante_assessment_fr_017_no_persist", "label": "FR-017 / Principle V: contract content must not persist to version control", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".specify/bugs/contrato-json-inferido-inoperante/assessment.md", "source_location": "L304-L309, L692-L694", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The contract may carry sensitive business data, so only the cache-key hash may be persisted; Metade C collides frontally with this rule if the raw contract is persisted into the (versioned) generated project - hence the derived-snapshot recommendation, later superseded when the maintainer chose the raw contract and the FR was explicitly amended."}, {"id": "_specify_bugs_contrato_json_inferido_inoperante_assessment_custom_entity_attributes_list", "label": "custom_entity_attributes_list flag (strict Tipo:nome,... format + catalog validationRegex)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".specify/bugs/contrato-json-inferido-inoperante/assessment.md", "source_location": "L214-L221", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_specify_bugs_contrato_json_inferido_inoperante_assessment_enable_custom_entity_attributes", "label": "enable_custom_entity_attributes flag (forced true when derived attributes exist)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".specify/bugs/contrato-json-inferido-inoperante/assessment.md", "source_location": "L43-L44, L432-L434", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Forced to true whenever the derived attribute list is non-empty - the template only renders extra fields inside the enable_custom_entity_attributes == true branch."}, {"id": "_specify_bugs_contrato_json_inferido_inoperante_assessment_entity_name", "label": "entity_name flag (LLM-estimated from prompt + contract via allowlist)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".specify/bugs/contrato-json-inferido-inoperante/assessment.md", "source_location": "L448-L457", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_specify_bugs_contrato_json_inferido_inoperante_assessment_enable_folder_src_test_java_guard", "label": "enable_folder_src_test_java guard (deleteFolder(src/test/resources) when false)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".specify/bugs/contrato-json-inferido-inoperante/assessment.md", "source_location": "L79-L83, L167-L172", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "When false (the default), the post-processor deletes src/test/java and src/test/resources entirely - so any contract persistence must either run after this cleanup or be guarded by the flag; 8 of the 10 IT profiles have the flag false."}, {"id": "_specify_bugs_contrato_json_inferido_inoperante_assessment_flagproposalmerger_groovy", "label": "FlagProposalMerger.groovy - unit-testable mirror of Orchestrator merge", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".specify/bugs/contrato-json-inferido-inoperante/assessment.md", "source_location": "L192-L194", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "ed